{
  "$comment": "Usage of a reply the user stopped midway. Same estimate as the skill marker interrupted leg: input = the request's existing input estimate (budget estimatedInput), output = estimateText(visibleText) + estimateText(reasoningText), estimateText(s) = ceil(utf8Bytes(s) * rhoHi) in IEEE double, empty text = 0. Legs that finished before the stop keep their reported usage and are added field by field. costSource assumes a priced model; the cost itself comes from the existing cost derivation fed with these tokens (free, subscription and hosted rules unchanged). A null member must be None (never 0). Nothing visible and no finished leg means nothing is recorded: no token fields, cost unknown, no usage report, no skillManifestTokens; finished legs are always kept, the stopped leg with nothing visible adds nothing. Hosted (managed) stops take the tokens of the server settlement returned by cancel; cache fields only when usage_source is upstream_reported; a pending settlement writes nothing until it settles.",
  "schema": "oriveo.fixture.interrupted-turn/v1",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "stopped-with-text",
      "path": "byok",
      "input": {
        "estimatedInput": 1200,
        "rhoHi": 0.5,
        "visibleText": "Hello",
        "reasoningText": "",
        "skillManifestTokens": 87
      },
      "expect": {
        "recorded": true,
        "inputTokens": 1200,
        "outputTokens": 3,
        "costSource": "localEstimate",
        "skillManifestTokens": 87
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stopped-with-reasoning-and-text",
      "path": "byok",
      "input": {
        "estimatedInput": 800,
        "rhoHi": 0.6,
        "visibleText": "你好",
        "reasoningText": "think",
        "skillManifestTokens": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "recorded": true,
        "inputTokens": 800,
        "outputTokens": 7,
        "costSource": "localEstimate",
        "skillManifestTokens": null
      },
      "note": "ceil(6 * 0.6) = 4 plus ceil(5 * 0.6) = 3"
    },
    {
      "id": "stopped-before-output",
      "path": "byok",
      "input": {
        "estimatedInput": 1200,
        "rhoHi": 0.5,
        "visibleText": "",
        "reasoningText": "",
        "skillManifestTokens": 87
      },
      "expect": {
        "recorded": false,
        "inputTokens": null,
        "outputTokens": null,
        "costSource": "unknown",
        "skillManifestTokens": null
      }
    },
    {
